1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twelfth Episode
The Prince and the Gypsy

15
00:02:14,021 --> 00:02:17,650
I see Prince Sapphire is
coming! Good morning, Sapphire!

16
00:02:17,821 --> 00:02:19,539
Good morning, Tink!

17
00:02:22,581 --> 00:02:24,173
Hey!

18
00:02:25,581 --> 00:02:27,890
Reckless! Were you
trying to kill yourself?!

19
00:02:30,021 --> 00:02:32,012
What the hell is going on here?

20
00:02:32,061 --> 00:02:34,017
Did you see that
you almost ran me over?

21
00:02:34,061 --> 00:02:36,017
But he's the one who ran right at me!

22
00:02:36,621 --> 00:02:40,296
If that's really the case, I
apologize for my friend's mistake.

23
00:02:40,901 --> 00:02:43,017
What? So you already know each other!

24
00:02:43,061 --> 00:02:45,495
Anyway, fortunately,
he didn't get hurt!

25
00:02:45,541 --> 00:02:48,009
You think so?
It seems the opposite to me!

26
00:02:49,021 --> 00:02:51,012
Ow, that hurts!

27
00:02:52,261 --> 00:02:55,094
- Are you kidding?!
- Listen here, pretty boy!

28
00:02:55,141 --> 00:02:58,611
How dare you? You hurt my
friend and you dare to laugh in his face?

29
00:02:58,661 --> 00:03:00,538
You're going to get a lesson!

30
00:03:01,901 --> 00:03:05,257
- No, not tickling! Stop it!
- Get him!

31
00:03:06,741 --> 00:03:09,209
- But where did he go?
- Where did he disappear to?

32
00:03:09,261 --> 00:03:11,138
- He was right there!
- Damn!

33
00:03:11,541 --> 00:03:13,372
I'm here!

34
00:03:17,101 --> 00:03:19,490
Wow, you're so strong!

35
00:03:19,581 --> 00:03:22,573
Of course, because he
is the Prince of Silverland!

36
00:03:22,621 --> 00:03:25,499
What?! A Prince should
be much more elegant.

37
00:03:26,021 --> 00:03:29,013
I'll tell you, you don't seem
very well-dressed either.

38
00:03:29,061 --> 00:03:32,133
Yes, but it doesn't matter to me.
I am a gypsy.

39
00:03:32,181 --> 00:03:35,218
Gypsy? What is the characteristic
of a gypsy?

40
00:03:35,261 --> 00:03:38,378
Gypsies are nomads.
My people are always on the move.

41
00:03:38,421 --> 00:03:40,491
You know, to make a living,
we go around singing,

42
00:03:40,541 --> 00:03:43,009
doing magic tricks
or stealing.

43
00:03:43,061 --> 00:03:45,017
My name is Gem.

44
00:03:45,181 --> 00:03:47,741
Are your parents
gypsies too?

45
00:03:51,221 --> 00:03:54,213
Yes, they were,
but they died a long time ago.

46
00:03:54,261 --> 00:03:56,616
I would love
to be a Prince too.

47
00:03:56,661 --> 00:03:59,175
I would like to have
a palace all to myself.

48
00:03:59,221 --> 00:04:01,689
Do you want to become
the master of a palace?

49
00:04:01,741 --> 00:04:03,811
Are you making fun of
me? I don't have a penny!

50
00:04:03,861 --> 00:04:06,011
How do I become
the owner of a palace?

51
00:04:06,061 --> 00:04:08,416
And yet, for one day,
you will be able to have it.

52
00:04:08,621 --> 00:04:10,851
What do you plan
to do, Sapphire?

53
00:04:16,741 --> 00:04:20,336
- See?
- May I know what you want to do?

54
00:04:20,381 --> 00:04:22,736
Hey! Like this, now,
he looks a lot like you!

55
00:04:22,781 --> 00:04:26,012
I'm reading a book called
"The Prince and the Pauper".

56
00:04:26,061 --> 00:04:28,734
Here it is! It's the story
of a Prince and a beggar...

57
00:04:28,781 --> 00:04:31,215
...who switch roles.
A beautiful story!

58
00:04:31,261 --> 00:04:33,092
I will make it a reality!

59
00:04:33,141 --> 00:04:36,258
And since I now know a poor
boy, I will swap roles with him!

60
00:04:36,741 --> 00:04:40,416
- Are you up for it, Gem?
- I want to see what will happen!

61
00:04:42,701 --> 00:04:45,261
Geez! How long are they going to take
to change?

62
00:04:51,221 --> 00:04:54,611
Darn! Dressed like that, I don't
recognize them! They look identical to me!

63
00:04:54,701 --> 00:04:58,171
Now we will change our lives!
Do you agree, Gem?

64
00:04:58,221 --> 00:05:00,177
Yes! I'm going to eat right away!

65
00:05:08,141 --> 00:05:10,177
Wait! Where are you running?

66
00:05:14,261 --> 00:05:16,331
Hey! Wait! Where are you running?

67
00:05:16,381 --> 00:05:20,010
Finally free!
I'll be able to do whatever I want!

68
00:05:20,061 --> 00:05:23,417
And no etiquette! Magnificent!

69
00:05:25,221 --> 00:05:28,770
I'll be able to play all the time!
No more studying!

70
00:05:29,901 --> 00:05:32,574
Who is that rude person
who knocked over my sign?!

71
00:05:33,821 --> 00:05:35,652
But that's Tink!

72
00:05:38,421 --> 00:05:40,491
Help, Sapphire!
Please, help me!

73
00:05:40,541 --> 00:05:42,259
What's going on, Tink?

74
00:05:42,301 --> 00:05:44,496
I've been kidnapped
by the street urchins!

75
00:05:45,581 --> 00:05:48,812
Hey, you!
Are you by any chance friends with this flea?

76
00:05:49,301 --> 00:05:52,134
Of course! You mustn't bully
the weak!

77
00:05:52,181 --> 00:05:54,251
How dare you speak to me like that?

78
00:05:54,301 --> 00:05:57,099
- Do you want me to teach you a lesson?
- Boss, make him fight!

79
00:05:57,141 --> 00:06:00,133
Good idea! If you want to bring
this kid back,

80
00:06:00,181 --> 00:06:03,014
- you'll have to beat me!
- Do I have to fight?

81
00:06:06,021 --> 00:06:09,934
- Then come on! Bring it on!
- I'm going to have fun, rookie!

82
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:15,338
Help!

83
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,413
Help!

84
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:20,296
- Help us!
- Come on! You can do it!

85
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:23,818
But it's not deep!

86
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:27,498
Help!
It's true, you can touch the bottom.

87
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:32,931
- We're even! Shall we do another
try? - Yes, I'm up for it too!

88
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:39,851
Look what I'm capable of!

89
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:47,214
- Did you see?
- And now look at me!

90
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:57,417
- Well done! Excellent!
- Really funny!

91
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:04,455
Hi! How is it going? Why aren't you answering?
Don't you know that I am the Prince?

92
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,537
You must respect me!

93
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:09,220
You must reply to my greeting
with the utmost deference!

94
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:11,698
It's empty...

95
00:07:15,340 --> 00:07:18,014
To those maidens
I must look very funny.

96
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:25,654
Help, they want to kill me!

97
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:39,616
Sapphire, look at that beautiful sunset!

98
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:43,891
Yes, it's beautiful, but now I have to go

99
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:46,136
I'm coming with you, Sapphire! Wait!

100
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,735
Please,
could I have some water?

101
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:32,653
Ah, it's you, Gem! Thank
goodness you're back!

102
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,851
We thought you had left us!

103
00:08:45,261 --> 00:08:49,539
Gem, I want to tell your fortune. Let's
see what destiny has in store for you.

104
00:08:50,901 --> 00:08:53,779
So: one, five, eight.

105
00:08:53,821 --> 00:08:57,291
I'll put this one here, this other
one here, then like this and then..

106
00:08:58,021 --> 00:09:01,013
My dear Gem, your card is.

107
00:09:02,741 --> 00:09:04,459
Here it is!

108
00:09:08,021 --> 00:09:10,819
According to this card,
you're a girl?!

109
00:09:12,421 --> 00:09:15,015
By now I've become
too old!

110
00:09:16,661 --> 00:09:19,653
My magic doesn't work anymore!

111
00:09:24,821 --> 00:09:27,540
Little brother, I'm glad
that you're back!

112
00:09:27,581 --> 00:09:29,572
I saved some food for you!

113
00:09:29,661 --> 00:09:33,574
Hey, where are you two going? Today he
didn't even earn a single cent,

114
00:09:33,621 --> 00:09:36,215
so he is only entitled to
half a portion, if he wants it!

115
00:09:36,261 --> 00:09:38,855
And if he doesn't want it, all the better!

116
00:09:39,821 --> 00:09:41,413
Come on, Gem!

117
00:09:45,301 --> 00:09:48,179
I realized that you are not Gem.
Who are you?

118
00:09:48,221 --> 00:09:52,134
I am Gem's sister! I won't tell
anyone that you're not the real Gem,

119
00:09:52,181 --> 00:09:54,695
but please,
tell me where he is now.

120
00:09:54,821 --> 00:09:57,460
You know, Gem and I have
swapped roles.

121
00:09:57,501 --> 00:09:59,810
Now he plays the Prince
instead of me.

122
00:10:00,781 --> 00:10:03,011
Really? But that is magnificent!

123
00:10:03,061 --> 00:10:07,020
Oh, here's Lizzie! Hello! You know, this
little sparrow is my best friend.

124
00:10:07,061 --> 00:10:09,131
Every evening he returns to me.

125
00:10:09,221 --> 00:10:11,052
What? Is it already evening?!

126
00:10:11,101 --> 00:10:13,137
Good grief, how late it has gotten!

127
00:10:13,861 --> 00:10:16,694
It will be dark soon
and Sapphire is still nowhere to be seen!

128
00:10:17,421 --> 00:10:19,218
Oh, here's Gem!

129
00:10:19,501 --> 00:10:21,298
Hello, Tink!

130
00:10:24,341 --> 00:10:26,332
I had to do a lot of things
at the castle.

131
00:10:26,381 --> 00:10:28,337
I'm dead tired!

132
00:10:35,021 --> 00:10:37,137
My loyal followers, I will give you
what remains of the potion

133
00:10:37,181 --> 00:10:39,217
...that can reveal
if Sapphire is male or female!

134
00:10:39,261 --> 00:10:41,491
- Try not to fail this time!
- We put the liquid...

135
00:10:41,541 --> 00:10:43,896
...on the tips of the swords,
so, if we touch a boy,

136
00:10:43,941 --> 00:10:45,852
- he will turn blue!
- If we touch a girl, red!

137
00:10:45,901 --> 00:10:47,732
If we touch a man, yellow!

138
00:10:49,621 --> 00:10:51,418
Get ready to surround him!

139
00:10:51,661 --> 00:10:53,617
Nylon's assassins!

140
00:10:55,021 --> 00:10:57,854
What do you want? Don't you know
that I am the Prince?

141
00:10:58,221 --> 00:11:01,019
Precisely! We were just
waiting for you, Your Highness.

142
00:11:02,301 --> 00:11:04,132
Hit! Perfect!

143
00:11:04,341 --> 00:11:06,138
Help!

144
00:11:09,341 --> 00:11:11,218
He's running away! Chase him!

145
00:11:12,821 --> 00:11:14,652
End of the line, Your Highness!

146
00:11:14,701 --> 00:11:16,692
Don't worry,
it was just a joke!

147
00:11:16,741 --> 00:11:19,130
That was only water!
Lift your face a little!

148
00:11:19,181 --> 00:11:21,297
- Just water?
- But you're a boy!

149
00:11:21,341 --> 00:11:24,413
Of course I'm a boy! Why?
What's strange about that?

150
00:11:24,581 --> 00:11:28,017
Oh, no! But then..! Then..!

151
00:11:44,621 --> 00:11:46,418
This way!

152
00:11:49,901 --> 00:11:52,176
Gem must already be
waiting for me. Let's hurry!

153
00:11:52,221 --> 00:11:53,654
Yes!

154
00:11:55,621 --> 00:11:58,010
Alarm! Alarm!

155
00:12:02,021 --> 00:12:05,013
Gem, you know you can't
leave here!

156
00:12:05,061 --> 00:12:08,417
Go back to sleep immediately,
otherwise it'll be worse for you!

157
00:12:13,861 --> 00:12:16,011
Nylon, repeat that once more.

158
00:12:16,381 --> 00:12:20,010
It is so, Grand Duke: the Prince
turns out to be male!

159
00:12:20,781 --> 00:12:24,251
Then there must be something
wrong with the potion!

160
00:12:24,341 --> 00:12:26,059
That's not possible, Grand Duke!

161
00:12:26,101 --> 00:12:28,490
I have tested that potion
several times...

162
00:12:28,541 --> 00:12:31,260
..and it has always turned out to be
highly effective!

163
00:12:31,301 --> 00:12:34,896
Damn it! If the Prince is
really a boy, I am ruined!

164
00:12:34,941 --> 00:12:37,535
I can't believe it!
Nylon, come here!

165
00:12:37,581 --> 00:12:40,698
- Yes, sir!
- The only thing left is to kill Sapphire!

166
00:12:40,741 --> 00:12:43,130
It is not that simple
with that little devil, Grand Duke!

167
00:12:43,661 --> 00:12:46,255
I can believe it! With those idiots
at your service!

168
00:12:46,301 --> 00:12:49,338
That is why you must win
the trust of the gypsies!

169
00:12:51,101 --> 00:12:53,012
Yes, I'm beginning to understand.

170
00:13:00,621 --> 00:13:04,011
No, it's not what you think!
I had no intention of running away!

171
00:13:04,061 --> 00:13:06,734
I only wanted to send the real Gem
back among you!

172
00:13:06,781 --> 00:13:10,615
We exchanged clothes
to try a different life.

173
00:13:10,661 --> 00:13:13,414
He was able to spend
a day in my castle,

174
00:13:13,461 --> 00:13:15,611
because I am the Prince
of Silverland.

175
00:13:15,661 --> 00:13:19,700
What the hell am I hearing?! Hey,
friends! Did you hear that too?

176
00:13:19,741 --> 00:13:21,413
Gem has gone crazy!

177
00:13:23,301 --> 00:13:25,417
It's true! I am a real Prince!

178
00:13:30,341 --> 00:13:32,252
But you must believe me!

179
00:13:36,381 --> 00:13:38,849
Please forgive my brother!

180
00:13:38,901 --> 00:13:40,619
He didn't do anything wrong!

181
00:13:40,661 --> 00:13:44,017
Nothing wrong?! He wanted to sneak off
so he wouldn't have to work anymore!

182
00:13:44,061 --> 00:13:46,291
On this,
the law of the gypsies is drastic:

183
00:13:46,341 --> 00:13:48,059
no forgiveness!

184
00:13:48,101 --> 00:13:50,695
I will work hard
and earn for him too!

185
00:13:51,421 --> 00:13:54,572
If you promise to work
for him as well, then things change.

186
00:13:54,621 --> 00:13:57,454
Come on, boys!
Cut Pepper's ropes!

187
00:13:58,421 --> 00:14:01,413
You will go to the city to
sell this bundle of firewood.

188
00:14:01,461 --> 00:14:03,577
Do I have to go to the city right away?

189
00:14:03,661 --> 00:14:07,449
If you sell this bundle before
dawn, I will free your brother.

190
00:14:07,741 --> 00:14:11,290
He won't be able to sell it!
How can he sell it at night?

191
00:14:11,341 --> 00:14:14,299
If he fails to sell it,
you will be hanged.

192
00:14:21,501 --> 00:14:24,493
Have faith, brother.
I will definitely sell it.

193
00:14:24,901 --> 00:14:26,732
Good luck.

194
00:15:13,021 --> 00:15:14,613
What could that be?

195
00:15:20,701 --> 00:15:24,376
I'm too scared! The
forest is terrible at night!

196
00:15:24,621 --> 00:15:27,454
I will never make it, my little brother!

197
00:15:39,181 --> 00:15:41,012
It's the city!

198
00:15:50,821 --> 00:15:53,540
Selling firewood!
Do you want firewood?

199
00:15:53,581 --> 00:15:55,219
No, thank you!

200
00:15:57,901 --> 00:16:01,894
Do you want to buy firewood?
I have a bundle of firewood!

201
00:16:13,701 --> 00:16:15,453
My firewood!

202
00:16:15,701 --> 00:16:17,817
Oh, what trouble!

203
00:16:21,141 --> 00:16:23,211
I must try to get it back!

204
00:16:29,581 --> 00:16:33,699
Help! Help! Help!

205
00:16:38,061 --> 00:16:42,020
- Help me! I'm drowning!
- I hear screams!

206
00:16:43,901 --> 00:16:46,893
Good heavens!
That girl is in danger of drowning!

207
00:16:47,101 --> 00:16:50,013
- Help! Help!
- I will save her!

208
00:16:50,261 --> 00:16:52,331
Give me your hand! Like this!

209
00:16:53,021 --> 00:16:55,012
I won't make it on my own...!

210
00:16:55,901 --> 00:16:58,461
Please, friend lightning,
give me a hand!

211
00:17:09,901 --> 00:17:12,734
Thank you, friend!
I will always be grateful to you

212
00:17:13,741 --> 00:17:16,414
Hey, you! Please, open your eyes!
Don't die!

213
00:17:30,021 --> 00:17:32,012
I feel so cold!

214
00:17:36,941 --> 00:17:38,659
Dad!

215
00:17:52,181 --> 00:17:54,012
Mom!

216
00:18:35,581 --> 00:18:37,412
Open your eyes, please!

217
00:18:39,821 --> 00:18:43,131
Don't die! I helped you!
You must go on living!

218
00:18:45,741 --> 00:18:48,539
Lord!
Please, Lord, save her!

219
00:18:54,781 --> 00:18:57,011
I have never asked you for anything,
but now I beg you:

220
00:18:57,061 --> 00:18:58,858
do me this favor!

221
00:18:59,581 --> 00:19:01,253
Oh my!

222
00:19:17,221 --> 00:19:19,860
How wonderful,
I saw my mother in a dream!

223
00:19:20,661 --> 00:19:24,210
And what is this? It must be
a gift she gave me!

224
00:19:24,261 --> 00:19:26,013
Thank you, mom!

225
00:19:29,621 --> 00:19:31,691
I thank you, Lord.

226
00:19:36,341 --> 00:19:38,730
Hey, Gem! Pepper hasn't returned!

227
00:19:38,781 --> 00:19:42,376
If she doesn't come back before
dawn, I'll play a nasty trick on you!

228
00:19:52,141 --> 00:19:54,018
I made it!

229
00:19:54,861 --> 00:19:56,613
Well done, Pepper!

230
00:19:59,021 --> 00:20:00,659
Look!

231
00:20:02,421 --> 00:20:05,891
This is gold!
Look how it shines!

232
00:20:05,941 --> 00:20:08,535
You can free Gem now, too!

233
00:20:09,621 --> 00:20:12,181
- Pepper, I'm so happy!
- I'm happy too!

234
00:20:12,221 --> 00:20:16,009
Excuse me! , 
I have something to ask you!

235
00:20:16,421 --> 00:20:20,175
Whatever you want! I
know your master pays well!

236
00:20:20,221 --> 00:20:23,099
You will get a lot of
money, if you kill the Prince.

237
00:20:23,141 --> 00:20:25,211
Damn it! Gem will get
caught in the middle!

238
00:20:25,261 --> 00:20:28,333
The Prince, this morning, will
take a walk with Baron Nylon.

239
00:20:28,381 --> 00:20:30,133
You will ambush him!

240
00:20:30,181 --> 00:20:33,617
You will take care of it
yourself with four of your men!

241
00:20:35,421 --> 00:20:38,493
A Prince should be worth
a tidy sum.

242
00:20:38,661 --> 00:20:41,414
- Hey! Nick and Jaguar!
- Yes, boss!

243
00:20:41,461 --> 00:20:43,531
- Cutty and Sal!
- Here we are!

244
00:20:43,581 --> 00:20:46,015
Remember, boys,
we must not fail!

245
00:20:46,061 --> 00:20:47,653
Good!

246
00:20:47,821 --> 00:20:49,891
Good heavens, Gem is in danger!

247
00:20:49,941 --> 00:20:52,501
Prince, please,
help my brother!

248
00:20:52,541 --> 00:20:55,055
If Gem were to die,
I would die too!

249
00:21:00,581 --> 00:21:02,492
My little Lizzie!

250
00:21:02,741 --> 00:21:04,652
Don't worry, Pepper!

251
00:21:04,701 --> 00:21:07,215
I will help your brother
and you'll see he won't die!

252
00:21:07,261 --> 00:21:08,819
I hope so!

253
00:21:09,621 --> 00:21:11,577
Like lightning!

254
00:21:30,021 --> 00:21:32,740
A long morning walk
is a wonderful thing.

255
00:21:32,781 --> 00:21:36,569
Don't you think, Prince? I am
honored to accompany you.

256
00:21:36,981 --> 00:21:40,610
I already feel a bit tired. I would
prefer to return to the castle.

257
00:21:42,821 --> 00:21:45,699
How about a nice race to
the castle, Your Highness?

258
00:21:46,421 --> 00:21:48,252
But where is he going?

259
00:21:50,021 --> 00:21:53,809
How distracted that Nylon is!
He went in the opposite direction.

260
00:21:59,701 --> 00:22:01,578
Help!

261
00:22:02,301 --> 00:22:07,329
Help, Prince! Help! Help!

262
00:22:14,781 --> 00:22:16,499
Gem, I'm coming!

263
00:22:25,301 --> 00:22:28,577
Just in time, Prince!
Thank goodness you arrived!

264
00:22:29,741 --> 00:22:31,777
Damn it!
What does this brat want?

265
00:22:31,821 --> 00:22:33,732
- Gypsies!
- Here we are!

266
00:22:34,421 --> 00:22:37,618
- They are here!
- For all the devils in hell!

267
00:22:37,661 --> 00:22:40,414
But that's Gem!
What are you doing here?

268
00:22:40,461 --> 00:22:42,816
- Go back! Go!
- Sorry to disappoint you,

269
00:22:42,861 --> 00:22:45,011
but I'm not going back at all!

270
00:22:46,461 --> 00:22:48,691
Ah, is that so? Now you'll see!

271
00:23:17,781 --> 00:23:21,251
Well done, Prince!
You're just as strong as I thought!

272
00:23:21,301 --> 00:23:23,212
What happened to the assassins?

273
00:23:23,261 --> 00:23:26,139
The end they deserved!
They're down there, over that way.

274
00:23:31,661 --> 00:23:34,380
And tell me, did you like it
at the castle?

275
00:23:35,741 --> 00:23:38,096
No, there is nothing interesting.

276
00:23:38,141 --> 00:23:40,496
And what about you? Did you have fun?

277
00:23:40,821 --> 00:23:43,460
Well, you know, "fun"
isn't the right word.

278
00:23:43,501 --> 00:23:46,015
But I'm glad
to have been among the gypsies

279
00:23:46,061 --> 00:23:48,017
I've learned a lot of things.

280
00:23:48,341 --> 00:23:50,218
Really, Sapphire?

281
00:23:50,821 --> 00:23:54,052
Anyway, it's time to say goodbye.
Pepper is waiting for you.

282
00:23:54,101 --> 00:23:55,739
Of course!

283
00:24:00,141 --> 00:24:02,609
But then the real Prince
was the fake Prince...

284
00:24:02,661 --> 00:24:05,016
...and the one who was Prince
was not the Prince!

285
00:24:05,061 --> 00:24:08,133
I don't understand anything anymore,
damn it!

286
00:24:33,420 --> 00:24:37,040
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

287
00:24:37,041 --> 00:24:40,401
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

288
00:24:40,402 --> 00:24:44,172
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

289
00:24:44,173 --> 00:24:47,334
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

290
00:24:47,335 --> 00:24:51,148
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

291
00:24:51,149 --> 00:24:54,445
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

292
00:24:54,446 --> 00:24:58,451
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

293
00:24:58,452 --> 00:25:01,890
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

294
